int[] arr = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
for (int i = 0; i < arr.length(); i++) {  // Compilation error!
    System.out.println(arr[i]);
}

// ✅ CORRECT - No parentheses
for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {  // Works
    System.out.println(arr[i]);
}
```

**3. Not Initializing Before Use:**
```java
